Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Location - Set in the heart of Expo City Dubai, with direct access to Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road (E311) and the Red Line Metro.</li><li>Flexible Unit Mix - 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, with starting prices from AED 1.69M.</li><li>Generous Layouts - Spacious units ranging from 890 to 2,251 sq. ft., each with a private balcony.</li><li>Post-Handover Payment Plan - 65/35 structure with instalments extended over 12 months from completion.</li><li>Earth-Inspired Design - Architecture shaped by the contours of the land, with soft natural tones throughout.</li><li>Sustainability-Led Lifestyle - Native planting, smart irrigation, and water reuse systems aligned with UAE Net Zero 2050.</li><li>Two-Level Amenity Ecosystem - Ground-floor and podium amenities including pools, gyms, kids' clubs, and a community plaza.</li><li>Walkable Community - Shaded paths, courtyards, and terraces designed for quiet, connected living.</li><li>Strong Investment Fundamentals - Located in Dubai's fastest-growing residential corridor.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2191,"cta":{"id":3025,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_d669c02f6b.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_d669c02f6b","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Connected Living in the Heart of Expo City","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Roudah is set within Expo Valley Views, in the heart of Expo City Dubai, one of the emirate's fastest-growing residential corridors. Residents are surrounded by Al Wasl Plaza, Terra, and the city's thriving cultural and business hub, with the Dubai Exhibition Centre just minutes away.</p><p>